  "R20_Novelty_Constraint": "FCT is equivalent to VCC 2026 CellularAI (mu_t * 2^log2FC); CASTER performed supervised control-variance scaling. TMVS is framed strictly as a parameter-free variance-ratio variant of expression-aware transfer (not a new method); contribution is the pre-registered 3-layer decomposition of recoverable zero-shot line-specific residuals into (1) line-wide amplitude, (2) gene marginal variance, and (3) off-diagonal co-fluctuations."
